\**{c=red:Note:}** This Mission is essentially identical for all 3 {z:Nations}. While each {z:Nations} requires you to travel to the other two, they all follow the same path.
:* {p:San d'Orians|San d'Oria} and {p:Windurstians|Windurst} who choose {p:Bastok} first will do the same things. Therefore, it IS possible to group people together from different {z:Nations} to ultimately end up on the same BCNM fight.
:* A {p:Windurstian|Windurst} may choose to do the {p:Bastok} portion first, and {p:San d'Orian|San d'Oria} portion second, while a {p:Bastokan|Bastok} can do the {p:Windurstian|Windurst} portion first, and the {p:San d'Orian|San d'Oria} portion second. In this scenario, {p:Windurstians|Windurst} and {p:Bastokans|Bastok} can enter the same BCNM for the {p:San d'Orian|San d'Oria} portion.
:* Players who have already completed this Mission (for any {z:Nation}) may enter any of the BC, except for the one associated with their Nation (A {p:Windurstian|Windurst} who has completed 2-3 is unable to enter the Giddeus BCNM to help others, unless they have completed this battle through another Nation's 2-3 Mission).

=2 Walkthrough
Trade enough {p:Crystals|Crystal} (3+) to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* Talk to {p:Naji} outside the **President's Office** in the {z:Metalworks} HP #1 (J-8). You will be escorted to President {n:Karst}.
* You will be able to ask him a series of questions. Once you are done you will receive the {@k} {p:Letter to the consuls} Key Item, and be asked to head to either {p:San d'Oria} or {p:Windurst}.
** Select the bottom option "__No questions__." to skip the questions.

=2 Option 1: San d'Oria Path
=3 Bastok to San d'Oria
* If you have not been to {p:San d'Oria} yet, you can travel there one of two ways:
** On foot: {p:Bastok} > {z:South Gustaberg} north west exit > {z:North Gustaberg} > {z:Konschtat Highlands} > {z:Valkurm Dunes} > {z:La Theine Plateau} > {z:West Ronfaure} > {z:Northern San d'Oria}
** Via {p:Unity Warp}: directly to {z:East Ronfaure}

* Journey to the **Consulate of Bastok** in {z:Northern San d'Oria}. Speak with the receptionist {n:Baraka}, then with {n:Helaku} in the back room.
* Next go to {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} and speak to {p:Halver} who is located at (I-9). He will ask you to go to {z:Ghelsba Outpost}.
** You will receive {i:Cipher: Halver|Cipher: Halver|10158} at this point if you have completed the introductory Trust Quest and do not already have it.
** You must be on at least {p:Rhapsodies of Vana'diel} 1-6 to start obtaining Ciphers.
*** If you unlock {p:Rhapsodies of Vana'diel} 1-6 AFTER talking to {p:Halver}, you will need to wait until you finish this portion of the Mission to get the Cipher.
** If you received a cutscene for {p:The Voracious Resurgence} epilogue quests, you will need to zone before talking to him again. The correct cutscene mentions Warchief Vatgit.
* At (H-7) inside the {z:Ghelsba Outpost} you will find an {m:Orc} by the name of {m:Warchief Vatgit}. Defeat him.
** The {p:Survival Guide} in {z:Fort Ghelsba} is a short run. Just zone back out to Ghelsba and across the bridge.
* Return to the **Consulate of Bastok** and speak with {n:Helaku} again, who will now order you to proceed to {p:Windurst}.

=3 San d'Oria to Windurst
* If you have not been to {p:Windurst} yet, you can travel there one of two ways:
** On foot: {p:Bastok} > {z:South Gustaberg} north west exit > {z:North Gustaberg} > {z:Konschtat Highlands} > {z:Valkurm Dunes} > {z:Selbina} > {z:ride the boat|Ferry - Mhaura/Selbina} > {z:Mhaura} > {z:Buburimu Peninsula} > {z:Tahrongi Canyon} > {z:East Sarutabaruta} > {z:Windurst Woods}
** Via {p:Unity Warp}: directly to {z:East Sarutabaruta}

* Journey to the **Consulate of Bastok** in {z:Port Windurst} (F-6) and speak with {n:Melek}, behind the __Bastokan Consul door__ on the right.
** There is a {p:Taru} on top of the building directly facing the **Consulate** named {n:Machu-Kuchu} that can warp you to {z:Windurst Walls}.
* Next go to {z:Heavens Tower}, located in {z:Windurst Walls} (H-7), and speak with {n:Kupipi} through the **Clerical Chamber** door to receive the {@k} {k:Dark key}.
** You will receive {i:Cipher: Semih|Cipher: Semih|10157} at this point if you have completed the introductory Trust Quest and do not already have it.
** You must be on at least {p:Rhapsodies of Vana'diel} 1-6 to start obtaining Ciphers.
*** If you unlock {p:Rhapsodies of Vana'diel} 1-6 AFTER talking to {n:Kupipi}, you will need to wait until you finish this portion of the Mission to get the Cipher.
* Travel to {z:Giddeus}, enter {z:Balga's Dais}, and examine the **Burning Circle** to fight the {m:Black Dragon} and {m:Seeker}.
** Via {z:Giddeus} home point if you have it.
* Afterwards, head back to {z:Port Windurst} and speak with {n:Melek} again, who directs you to return to {p:Bastok}.
* Speak with {p:Naji} outside the **President's Office** in the {z:Metalworks} to complete the Mission and advance to Rank 3.
** You can get the next Mission from {n:Malduc} right beside {p:Naji}.

=2 Option 2: Windurst Path
=3 Bastok to Windurst
* If you have not been to {p:Windurst} yet, you can travel there one of two ways:
** On foot: {p:Bastok} > {z:South Gustaberg} north west exit > {z:North Gustaberg} > {z:Konschtat Highlands} > {z:Valkurm Dunes} > {z:Selbina} > {z:ride the boat|Ferry - Mhaura/Selbina} > {z:Mhaura} > {z:Buburimu Peninsula} > {z:Tahrongi Canyon} > {z:East Sarutabaruta} > {z:Windurst Woods}
** Via {p:Unity Warp}: directly to {z:East Sarutabaruta}

* Speak to {n:Melek} in {z:Port Windurst} (F-6) inside the **Bastokan Consulate**.

* Speak to {n:Kupipi} inside the {z:Heavens Tower} in {z:Windurst Walls}, to get the {@k} {k:Sword offering}.
* Speak to {n:Gold Skull} in {z:Port Windurst} (F-6) inside the **Bastokan Consulate** to get the {@k} {k:Dull sword}.
* Travel to {z:Giddeus} via {z:West Sarutabaruta} and speak to {n:Uu Zhoumo} (F-7 in Map 2).
** Get here by dropping down at (G-8), or walking down the ramp at (F-8).
* Kill {m:Eyy Mon the Ironbreaker} (spawns in the same map, at G-7) to obtain an {@i:Aspir Knife|16509} {p:Aspir Knife} (**{p:G|Guaranteed (100%)}**).
* Trade the {@i:Aspir Knife|16509} {p:Aspir Knife} to {n:Uu Zhoumo}.
* Return to {n:Melek}.

=3 Windurst to San d'Oria
* Speak to {n:Helaku} in {z:Northern San d'Oria} (K-10) inside the **Consulate of Bastok**, and then to {p:Halver} in {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} (I-9).
** If you have not been to {p:San d'Oria} yet, you can travel there one of two ways:
*** On foot: {p:Bastok} > {z:South Gustaberg} north west exit > {z:North Gustaberg} > {z:Konschtat Highlands} > {z:Valkurm Dunes} > {z:La Theine Plateau} > {z:West Ronfaure} > {z:Southern San d'Oria}
*** Via {p:Unity Warp}: directly to {z:East Ronfaure}

* Next, travel to {z:Horlais Peak} through {z:Yughott Grotto}.
* Examine the **Burning Circle** inside to enter the "The Rank 2 Final Mission" BCNM.
** Inside you will find a {m:Spotter} and {m:Dread Dragon}.
** It is recommended to {s:Sleep} the {m:Dread Dragon} while you take out the {m:Spotter} first.
** You only need to defeat the {m:Dread Dragon} to win the battle.
** {p:Trusts} can be summoned.
** Trivial at level 30 with a party of Trusts.
* You will obtain the {@k} {k:Kindred crest} Key Item.
* Return to {n:Helaku}. You will obtain the {@k} {k:Kindred report} Key Item.
* Finally, speak to {p:Naji} to complete this Mission and gain {p:Bastok} Rank 3.
** You can get the next Mission from {n:Malduc} right beside {p:Naji}.

